{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Skyblocker is a cozy and competitive 3D puzzle game in which players build their tower as high and as fast as they can. It's a fun and infinitely replayable indie title with six unique levels, dynamic weather, insightful player statistics, and gorgeous unlockable cosmetics. It has both a competitive mode with an online leaderboard for high scores, as well as a cozy &quot;Zen&quot; mode where you can relax and build with no added pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474920/extras/Untitled_design__34_.png?t=1744370337\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Skyblocker's advanced scoring system accounts for a broad range of factors such as your multiplier, average block placement time, and how high your tower reaches, just to name a few. Other player statistics are also recorded, such as lifetime number of blocks placed, lifetime mass of blocks placed, and the height of your highest tower. Play and compete for a high score with global online leaderboards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474920/extras/Copy_of_Untitled_Design__2_.png?t=1744370337\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are a total of six unique playable levels, all with optional dynamic weather including wind that could blow your tower over! There are also dozens of gorgeous in-game unlockable block skins, so you can customize your blocks with your favorite look!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Now you're Skyblocking!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3474920/d352a278e31c452b3830443432fbd0d63773b3dc.jpg"},{"name":"Brave new shores","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3474920/a74f6b156d1b482fe4578ebac18af096ff5ebfa6.jpg"},{"name":"Gettin' your hands dirty","path":"https://cdn.akamai.